# 👋 Hey there, I’m GreNxNja

Welcome to my corner of GitHub. I'm an **indie developer** building meaningful software that blends creativity with real-world utility. I experiment, learn, and ship projects that solve problems, improve experiences, or just bring ideas to life.

---

## 🧠 About Me

- 🛠 Full-stack developer (React, Node.js, Python, MongoDB)
- 🤖 AI enthusiast (NLP, Computer Vision, ML Models)
- 🎯 Focused on simplicity, usability, and performance
- 🚀 Building projects I believe in — solo and sometimes with collaborators

---

## 🔥 Noteworthy Projects

- **Epiphany** – AI-driven learning management system  
- **NextRead** – Personalized book discovery & journaling app  
- **Lunar PSR Enhancer** – Enhancing low-light space imagery using AI  
- **Web App Fuzzer** – Securing the web through automated fuzz testing

